-- check/bad (project): §10.4's caller case, and the assertion is span
-- ORDER, not just the set. `best` is annotated with a bare `a` and calls a
-- constrained `Lib.top`, so the requirement arrives by instantiation: the
-- PRIMARY span is the call in THIS file, and `Lib.top` is named in the
-- prose. Reversing the two is the Roc behaviour report 18 §2.4 complains
-- about (report 20 §7.2).
import Lib


pub best : a, a -> a
best x y =
    Lib.top x y
